const STORY = [{"en": "Today was a special day. Ping the Panda was going to choose a pet.\n\nFor a month, Ping had helped at home. He washed dishes with Mom, put away his toys, and helped clean the house.\n\nSome days he wanted to play instead. But he remembered his promise and finished his jobs.\n\n“You have worked hard,” Mom said. “Now we can look for a pet our family can care for.”"}, {"en": "On the way to the pet shop, Ping had many questions.\n\nWould his pet have feathers or fur? Would it have scales? Would it run, swim, or fly?\n\n“I want a pet I can play with,” he said.\n\n“Playing is important,” Mom replied. “What else will your pet need?”\n\nPing thought for a moment.\n\n“Food, water, and a safe home!”\n\n“And care every day,” said Mom."}, {"en": "The shop was full of sounds. Birds chirped. A puppy barked. Something rustled in a little bed.\n\nPing looked around with wide eyes.\n\nThere were rabbits, fish, snakes, kittens, and puppies. How could he choose just one?\n\n“First, we will learn about them,” Mom said. “Then we will decide.”\n\nThe shopkeeper smiled. “You can ask me questions.”"}, {"en": "Ping watched the birds hop between their perches.\n\n“They are beautiful,” he said.\n\nNext, he met the rabbits. One moved away when he reached toward it.\n\n“Let it come to you,” Mom said softly.\n\nPing sat still. Soon, a rabbit sniffed near his feet.\n\nThen he watched the fish swim through the water.\n\n“I like watching them,” Ping said. “But I think I want a different pet.”"}, {"en": "The shopkeeper showed Ping a red snake. With the shopkeeper helping, Ping watched it move slowly across his arm.\n\nIts tongue flicked out.\n\nPing laughed. “That tickles!”\n\n“Every animal needs the right home and care,” the shopkeeper explained.\n\nPing asked what the snake needed. He listened carefully.\n\n“There is a lot to learn,” he said."}, {"en": "A little gray kitten peeped out of a bed.\n\nPing rolled a toy across the floor. The kitten jumped after it, tumbled, and tried again.\n\nPing laughed so much that his tummy shook.\n\n“I like this kitten!” he said.\n\nMom smiled. “We would need to feed it, give it fresh water, keep its home clean, and make time to play. I would help you care for it.”"}, {"en": "Then a brown puppy climbed beside Ping and fell asleep against his leg.\n\n“I like this puppy too,” Ping whispered.\n\nMom and the shopkeeper explained its daily needs. Ping listened and thought about school, playing, and helping at home.\n\n“Can our family manage all of that?” he asked.\n\nTogether, they talked about their time and what they could provide.\n\n“I think the kitten is the right choice for us,” Ping said at last."}, {"en": "On the way home, Ping named his kitten Tiger.\n\nAt home, he and Mom made a care plan. Ping drew pictures beside his jobs so he could remember them.\n\nSoon, his friends called him outside.\n\n“I will come after I help Tiger settle in,” he said.\n\nPing had worked hard to earn a pet. Now he understood something more.\n\nChoosing a pet was the beginning of a promise.\n\nAnd Ping was ready to keep it."}];
